  "description": "One day, my best friend contacted me to say she had killed her boyfriend. Baek Seo-Jeong, who only dates handsome men, and Park Su-Jin, a former judo athlete. Having become accomplices in a murder, the two try to carry on with their lives as best they can, each in their own way. But why is it so hard to live an ordinary life like everyone else? Can life really fall apart this much just because you met the wrong person?\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
